# installs this exact package set. The four pinned packages are the released
# versions exercised by the maintained adapter. The two agentrust-io pins must
# equal tested_against in integrations/pic-standard-mcp-guard/integration.yaml.
# rfc8785, pytest, and packaging are the integration's direct runtime and test
# dependencies, which the --no-deps editable install does not pull in.
# The floating job remains unpinned on purpose for drift detection.
